  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your last action was a successful Grapple, Trip, or Shove against a creature.</p><hr><p>The ferocity of beasts courses through you, maiming your foes as you wrestle them. You deal @Damage[1d6[bludgeoning]] damage to the target you maneuvered. If you become a Master in Athletics, this damage increases to @Damage[2d6[bludgeoning]]. If you become Legendary in Athletics, this damage increases to @Damage[3d6[bludgeoning]]. If you used an anima weapon for the maneuver attempt, you add your key attribute modifier to the damage.</p>"
